<title>UK: Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on Swiss Re.</title>
<headline>Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on Swiss Re.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 25,000</p>
<p>BLOC warrants, on Swiss Re, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    *			ISSUE PRICE  1,294.50 SFR</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   13.JUN.97	    PAYDATE	24.DEC.96</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,375.00 SFR</p>
<p> NOTES	     *LOWER STRIKE PRICE IS 0.00 SFR AND THE</p>
<p>		    CAP-LEVEL WILL BE SET AT-THE-MONEY AND ROUNDED</p>
<p>		    TO THE NEXT FULL SFR BASED ON THE CLOSING PRICE</p>
<p>		    OF THE SHARES ON DECEMBER 17, 1996.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
